@startuml part12_difficulty_flow

!theme mimeograph

top to bottom direction

skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #ece9e8
skinparam nodesep 20
skinparam ranksep 30

skinparam noteFontSize 10
skinparam noteBorderThickness 1
skinparam noteMargin 2
skinparam notePadding 2

title Part 12: Floor-scaled spawn flow

component "GameWorld\n<color:#666666>generate_floor()</color>" as game_world
component "map_generator.py\n<color:#666666>generate_dungeon(..., current_floor)</color>" as generator
component "place_entities()\n<color:#666666>rolls counts and spawns templates</color>" as placement
component "Selection helpers\n<color:#666666>get_value_for_floor()\nget_entities_at_random()</color>" as selection
component "config.py\n<color:#666666>min/max entities by floor</color>" as config
component "factories.py\n<color:#666666>monster/item chances by floor</color>" as factories
component "GameMap\n<color:#666666>spawned monsters and items</color>" as game_map

game_world --> generator : current_floor
generator --> placement : for each room
placement --> config : read floor limits
placement --> factories : read spawn tables
placement --> selection : choose active templates
selection --> placement : return selected templates
placement --> game_map : spawn on free tiles

note bottom of config
  Plain numeric tables live here.
end note

note bottom of factories
  Template references and their
  floor-keyed weights live here.
end note

note bottom of selection
  Entries with a weight of 0 are not
  available on the current floor.
end note

' Keep the data sources side-by-side and the flow vertical.
config -[hidden]right- factories
game_world -[hidden]down- generator
generator -[hidden]down- placement
placement -[hidden]down- selection
selection -[hidden]down- game_map

@enduml
